- [ ] No active lane was overwritten or duplicated.
- [ ] Cross-lane regressions were either fixed or converted into bounded issues.
- [ ] Capability/programme state was refreshed from evidence.
- [ ] No phase gate was marked green with known P0/P1 blockers or missing mandatory human evidence.
- [ ] The next safe work frontier is explicit.

